sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User browser
 participant API as HTTP API
 participant WS as WebSocket server
 participant R as Redis
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>API: join room or request presence ticket
 API->>DB: authenticate and check role/membership
 API-->>U: room info / short-lived ticket
 U->>WS: upgrade with ticket subprotocol
 WS->>DB: recheck access and current role
 WS->>R: register participant lease
 WS-->>U: presence snapshot
 U->>WS: validated element commit
 WS->>R: update live snapshot and schedule flush
 WS-->>U: acknowledgement and peer broadcast
 R->>DB: worker inserts retained revision
